Phase 11 – Release Readiness UI/UX Enhancements & Deployment Readiness Improvements

Objective

This phase focuses on improving the Release Readiness page from a UI/UX perspective without changing any existing business functionality. The primary goal is to make the Release Readiness dashboard easier to use, improve filtering capabilities, reduce user effort, and present information in a much more intuitive manner.

Important

* This is an enhancement phase only.
* Existing functionality must not break.
* Existing backend logic should be reused wherever possible.
* Do not introduce unnecessary external API calls if the required information is already available in the database.

